{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1792763070","published":"2026-10-23T13:44:49Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:53.218324294Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-53150","CVE-2026-43284","CVE-2026-43503","CVE-2026-46113","CVE-2026-46300","CVE-2026-46331","CVE-2026-74480","CVE-2026-74581","CVE-2026-80714"],"summary":"Fix of 9 CVEs","details":"   * Bump kernel ABI to 31: ship the ELS kernel as 4.19.0-31-*, distinct from\n     the prior 4.19.0-30.\n   * CVE-2024-53150\n     - ALSA: usb-audio: Fix out of bounds reads when finding clock\n       sources {CVE-2024-53150}\n   * CVE-2026-43284\n     - xfrm: esp: avoid in-place decrypt on shared skb frags\n       {CVE-2026-43284}\n   * CVE-2026-43503\n     - net: skbuff: propagate shared-frag marker through frag-transfer\n       helpers {CVE-2026-43503}\n   * CVE-2026-46113\n     - KVM: x86: Fix shadow paging use-after-free due to unexpected\n       GFN/role {CVE-2026-46113}\n   * CVE-2026-46300\n     - net: skbuff: preserve shared-frag marker during coalescing\n       {CVE-2026-46300}\n   * CVE-2026-46331\n     - net/sched: fix pedit partial COW leading to page cache corruption\n       {CVE-2026-46331}\n   * CVE-2026-74480\n     - net: bridge: stop fast-leave after deleting a port group\n       {CVE-2026-74480}\n   * CVE-2026-74581\n     - net: ipv6: clear suppressed fib6 rule result {CVE-2026-74581}\n   * CVE-2026-80714\n     - ipvs: do not propagate one-packet flag to synced conns\n       {CVE-2026-80714}\n   * Miscellaneous upstream changes\n     - net: skbuff: propagate shared-frag marker in skb_zerocopy()","affected":[{"package":{"name":"hyperv-daemons","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/hyperv-daemons?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.19.325-4+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1792763070.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libbpf-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debi